    "interpretationNotes": [
      "AI_REVIEWED only. New interpretation requires its own human approval; task 001 approval does not cover this rule.",
      "Bounded subset: new RS office projects at CONCEPT/DESIGN; above-ground elements only. Reconstruction and excluded source categories are not modeled.",
